{"id":8461944,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/3336","number":3336,"state":"merged","title":"conv2d_v2算子optgroup preload场景aic及精度问题修复","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3336","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-nn/pulls/3336/issues","body":"## 描述\n对于conv2d_v2算子中的optgroup preload场景，由于进行了一次L1层级fmap的预载入，使得K方向，N方向及M方向的尾块载入和计算均需使用GroupOptIter进行尾块判断，且由于是错开进行，会使得尾块判断时Iter值使用错误造成算子产生aic及精度fail问题。本次修改主要涉及点如下\n1）存在GM2L1的Fmap搬运时，enlarge和singleCi值不直接相等的问题，导致offset计算错误导致精度失败；\n2）由于preload特性的存在，判断K方向尾块时应该使用tempIter中的Iter值，所以应使用透传的groupIter值进行是否尾块的判断；\n3）首块即尾块及单核DN2NZ执行仅有两次时，此处时要在FirstIterate中进行Tail值判断及参数更新；\n4）group轴及n轴都绑核时，需要判断n轴尾核是否不处理数据，并通过透传singleCoOpt值进行判断及参数更新。\n\n## 关联的Issue\nhttps://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/issues/1824\n\n## 测试\nRDV通过\n\n## 文档更新\n不涉及\n\n## 类型标签\n<!--  [x] 表示选中 -->\n- [x] Bug修复\n- [ ] 新特性\n- [ ] 性能优化\n- [ ] 文档更新\n- [ ] 其他，请描述：\n\n\n","assignees_number":7,"assignees":[{"id":"6880d13aba419813105ac7ab","login":"tangweiwei2","name":"tangweiwei2","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/tangweiwei2","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65c6a68fa1fec6cc32e","login":"crystalhu","name":"胡碧霞","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/crystalhu","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6861e48dadc5e31e4da8818d","login":"chenqi317","name":"chenqi317","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/chenqi317","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6863449ca39ca35309897c87","login":"lileizheng","name":"lileizheng","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/lileizheng","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6880ab8479db6d209b3bc340","login":"liubo75","name":"l